{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京公演(ノω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいほんとに嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はわー、言葉が出ない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白目ビーム!!‼‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪ライブ(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ遅くなっちゃってごめんなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解なんて、なかったみたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46初の単独ライブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれ色んな気持ちを抱えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで団結して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このライブが、わたしたちにとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれだけ大切なのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにとって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれだけ大切なのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がなくて、全員そろって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あわせる機会もなかなかなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このままでいいのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと ぶつかったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いたり話し合ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このライブに、どのくらいの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちを込めてるのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張でガチガチで、心臓がバクバクで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まる直前に涙が出て