,{"type":"paragraph","text":"でるものだと勝手に思ってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅも、アンダーメンバーも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい ってこと以外にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな感情があると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけどそこで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺の応援が足りなかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしがもっと支えてあげてれば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて考えないでください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんには、本当に本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝してるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが大好き、なんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで止まってられない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46は明日からも走り続ける。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅも負けてらんない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけどね、本当はね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテン踊りたかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そでで聴いてて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙がとまらなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい涙じゃなくて、感動したのと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張らなきゃって涙。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊乃木坂mix＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p